---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import logo from "../../res/games/hammerhex/logo.png";
---

<figure>
  <a
    target="_blank"
    href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/793440/Hammer_Hex"
    rel="nofollow noopener"
    referrerpolicy="origin"
  >
    <Image
      title="Wishlist on Steam"
      alt="Wishlist on Steam"
      src={logo}
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </a>
</figure>
<ul>
  <li>
    Your Magical Hammer&trade; is growing out of control! Use magical grindstones
    to shrink it back down so you can escape the wizard&#x27;s tower.
  </li>
</ul>
<h3>Team:</h3>
<ul>
  <li>
    <a href="https://benjamin-halko.itch.io/">Benjamin Halko</a> - Programming
  </li>
  <li>
    <a target="_blank" href="https://burritoeclair.itch.io/">BurritoEclair</a>
    - Art <br />
  </li>
  <li>
    <a target="_blank" href="https://bluishgreenpro.itch.io/">BluishGreenPro</a>
    - Level Design
  </li>
  <li><a href="https://frostowonder.itch.io/">Frosto</a> - Art</li>
  <li>
    <a
      href="https://soundcloud.com/motheraudio"
      rel="nofollow noopener"
      referrerpolicy="origin"
    >
      MOTHER Audio
    </a>
    - Music &amp; SFX
  </li>
  <li>
    <a
      href="https://soundcloud.com/rodney-halko"
      rel="nofollow noopener"
      referrerpolicy="origin"
    >
      Rodney Halko
    </a>
    &nbsp;- Music
  </li>
</ul>
<h3>GMTK 2024:</h3>
<ul>
  <li>This game was made in 96 hours for GMTK 2024</li>
  <li>The theme was:&nbsp;Built to Scale</li>
</ul>
<h3>Known Bugs:</h3>
<ul>
  <li>You can clip through portals if you approach them at a specific angle</li>
</ul>
